1195
01:08:01,650 --> 01:08:01,970
Oof.

1196
01:08:03,430 --> 01:08:04,390
Be careful.

1197
01:08:10,660 --> 01:08:11,800
Yep, yep, yep, yep.

1198
01:08:23,740 --> 01:08:24,660
Oh, that's...

1199
01:08:24,660 --> 01:08:25,420
Oh, that's beautiful.

1200
01:08:25,440 --> 01:08:26,020
Look at that.

1201
