1232
01:09:49,490 --> 01:09:49,650
Okay.

1233
01:09:50,530 --> 01:09:51,130
Surface sample.

1234
01:09:51,550 --> 01:09:52,730
Oh, 45 signs!

1235
01:09:53,330 --> 01:09:55,790
The surface seems to consist of tiny crystal-like grains.

1236
01:09:57,710 --> 01:09:58,290
Sweet.

1237
01:09:58,990 --> 01:09:59,870
Plant the flag.

1238
01:10:06,420 --> 01:10:10,800
Uh, rich start's glory.

1239
01:10:12,860 --> 01:10:21,740
After enduring years orbiting Kerbin, rich start finally was rescued.

1240
01:10:22,600 --> 01:10:30,360
And what better way to repay the favor than to rescue other Kerbals?

1241
01:10:32,860 --> 01:10:34,220
Good job, rich start.

1242
01:10:38,060 --> 01:10:41,060
