1243
01:10:45,600 --> 01:10:46,040
Okay.

1244
01:10:48,380 --> 01:10:49,060
Let's get in.

1245
01:10:54,380 --> 01:10:54,760
Boop!

1246
01:10:56,420 --> 01:10:56,840
Okay.

1247
