Uh, wait.

1253
01:11:04,680 --> 01:11:05,280
That way?

1254
01:11:05,460 --> 01:11:05,900
No.

1255
01:11:06,040 --> 01:11:06,540
Yeah, that way.

1256
01:11:06,920 --> 01:11:07,400
Here we go.

1257
01:11:10,060 --> 01:11:10,820
Oh, god!

1258
01:11:10,960 --> 01:11:11,420
Oh, shit!

1259
01:11:12,240 --> 01:11:13,320
Calm down, calm down!

1260
01:11:13,360 --> 01:11:13,960
Oh, we have no SAS.

1261
01:11:14,340 --> 01:11:14,660
There we go.

1262
01:11:15,400 --> 01:11:16,320
Forgot to activate SAS.

1263
01:11:17,400 --> 01:11:18,240
Jesus Christ.

1264
