Run Magneto Meter Report.

1266
01:11:23,960 --> 01:11:24,800
54 signs.

1267
01:11:25,640 --> 01:11:31,840
Trace magnetic fields are magnified by this sensitive instrument and measured in real time as you orbit near this celestial body.

1268
01:11:32,420 --> 01:11:38,900
It's almost like hearing the heartbeat of a planet, knowing if it's dead inside or if something is churning.

1269
01:11:40,500 --> 01:11:40,900
Cool.

1270
