Question, though.

1271
01:11:43,800 --> 01:11:45,220
Uh, we have a scientist with us.

1272
01:11:46,780 --> 01:11:48,420
Can you go out here and...

1273
01:11:48,420 --> 01:11:49,420
Download data?

1274
01:11:53,740 --> 01:11:55,280
Why is it called download data?

1275
01:11:58,840 --> 01:11:59,640
What the...

1276
