It can't be done right now.

1281
01:12:06,400 --> 01:12:07,680
Oh, I guess this can only be done on the surface.

1282
01:12:07,680 --> 01:12:08,120
Yeah, okay.

1283
01:12:08,240 --> 01:12:08,400
Fine.

1284
01:12:08,840 --> 01:12:09,200
Fine.

1285
01:12:10,900 --> 01:12:13,260
In fact, how about we take some seismic data from down there?

1286
01:12:15,440 --> 01:12:16,100
Let's do that.

1287
01:12:16,820 --> 01:12:17,740
