1288
01:12:19,960 --> 01:12:20,920
We're getting science.

1289
01:12:23,380 --> 01:12:24,280
Let me see if I can...

1290
01:12:24,280 --> 01:12:25,540
I'm looking at this right here.

1291
01:12:27,720 --> 01:12:28,200
Eyeballant.

1292
01:12:29,280 --> 01:12:30,840
And maybe this way slightly...

1293
01:12:30,840 --> 01:12:32,160
Slightly down, like that.

1294
01:12:33,080 --> 01:12:34,940
That's looking pretty good, I think.

1295
01:12:47,160 --> 01:12:48,600
Now we can start slowing down.

1296
01:12:48,840 --> 01:12:49,520
Oh, not target.

1297
01:12:49,760 --> 01:12:50,560
Put it on surface.

1298
