Nilden, get out there.

1310
01:13:40,600 --> 01:13:42,360
I want you to download this data now.

1311
01:13:42,560 --> 01:13:44,200
And let's see if we can store it with the other.

1312
01:13:45,720 --> 01:13:47,240
There's a chance we may not be able to.

1313
01:13:48,280 --> 01:13:49,180
